          "reason": "README 首句即“带时间盒与时间追踪的高级待办应用”，功能列表说明可在 schedule 时间轴上把一天铺开、与日历事件并列，并用 timeboxing 规划任务、跟踪时间并生成工时表。官方 Schedule Planner 页正文逐句写明：先“Set time estimates so the planner knows how much space each task needs in your day”，再“Drag tasks into the daily timeline”；执行阶段“If something takes longer, drag to reschedule the rest”；FAQ 还写明“Unfinished tasks carry forward automatically”，且“Every scheduled block is a real task with notes, subtasks, and logged time”。官方 Time Boxing 指南亦给出“Assign a time estimate to each task”“Slot these tasks into your calendar like Tetris blocks”“Drag & Drop Planning”与“Easily move tasks into time slots.”。任务→时间块分配、重新安排与未完成结转循环均有官方正文，仓库与 MIT 许可经元数据和许可证接口核实。",
